      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Find out whether your patio, carport or shed needs a building permit, and what the engineer's certificate has to show before a permit can be issued. Call (08) 5550 6237 and your enquiry goes to an independent structural engineer, who quotes you directly.</p>
